        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Profiling TorchNeuron (Part 1): System-level profiling on AWS Trainium.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://huggingface.co/blog/amazon/profiling-torchneuron-part-1",
        "source": "Hugging Face Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-21T16:04:43.000Z",
